{
  "_comment": [
    "Madeleine's tool catalog for evaluation purposes (MADELEINE.md §5).",
    "",
    "Three things live together in each entry, on purpose:",
    "  schema  — the OpenAI-shaped function definition sent to the model",
    "  class   — READ | WRITE_SAFE | WRITE_GATED, straight from SPECS §5",
    "  stub    — a canned result, so the eval needs no backend and no database",
    "",
    "The stubs are deliberately small and realistic: MADELEINE.md §4 trims tool",
    "results to toolResultMaxItems=8 named fields before they enter context, so",
    "an eval fed raw fat JSON would measure a context the real loop never sees.",
    "",
    "WRITE_GATED entries have no stub result. The runner returns",
    "PENDING_USER_APPROVAL for them, which is exactly what the real executor",
    "does (§4 step 3) — model output can never reach a gated side effect. A",
    "model that handles that reply gracefully is a model that can run this app;",
    "one that retries the same call in a loop is not."
  ],
